@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Recommendation Generation and Feedback

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor User
participant "React Web App" as Frontend
participant "Recommendation Controller" as Controller
participant "Recommendation Service" as Service
participant "Analytics Service" as Analytics
database "MySQL" as DB
collections "Redis" as Redis
participant "Configured Provider\n(Mock by Default)" as Provider
participant "Safety Validator" as Safety

User -> Frontend: Select recommendation type
Frontend -> Controller: POST /api/recommendations/generate
Controller -> Service: Generate(userId, type)
Service -> Redis: Increment hourly user rate counter

alt Rate limit exceeded
  Redis --> Service: Count above configured limit
  Service --> Controller: Rate-limit error
  Controller --> Frontend: 429 Too Many Requests
else Request allowed
  Service -> Analytics: Build weekly summary
  Analytics -> DB: Query profile, workouts, meals,\nbody records, goals and milestones
  DB --> Analytics: User-owned records
  Analytics -> Analytics: Calculate deterministic indicators
  Analytics --> Service: Structured weekly summary
  Service -> Service: Store prompt context JSON
  Service -> Provider: Generate(type, summary)

  alt Default mock provider
    Provider -> Provider: Apply deterministic guidance rules
  else OpenAI-compatible provider configured
    Provider -> Provider: Build constrained prompt\nand request completion
  end

  Provider --> Service: Recommendation content
  Service -> Safety: Check general-wellness boundaries

  alt Content rejected
    Safety --> Service: Unsafe
    Service --> Controller: Validation error
    Controller --> Frontend: 422 Unprocessable Entity
  else Content approved
    Safety --> Service: Approved
    Service -> DB: Save recommendation and context
    DB --> Service: Saved record
    Service --> Controller: Recommendation
    Controller --> Frontend: 201 Created
    Frontend --> User: Display recommendation
  end
end

User -> Frontend: Submit rating and comment
Frontend -> Controller: POST /api/recommendations/{id}/feedback
Controller -> Service: Verify ownership and save feedback
Service -> DB: Read recommendation; insert feedback
DB --> Service: Saved feedback
Service --> Controller: Feedback result
Controller --> Frontend: 201 Created
@enduml
